{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03825","headline":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山 · 姚崇","name":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二室三涂光地险，均霜揆日处天中。\n石泉石镜恒留月，山鸟山花竞逐风。\n周王久谢瑶池赏，汉主悬慙玉树宫。\n别有祥烟伴佳气，能随轻辇共葱葱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚崇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03825.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03825","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}